<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="band container" id="faq">
  <div class="section-head center">
    <span class="eyebrow">questions</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Good to know.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is my audio uploaded anywhere?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Not on the Free plan. Transcription runs on-device with local Whisper, and Privacy Mode stops anything from being written to disk. Cloud speed is strictly opt-in and uses your own API key.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Does it work offline?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. The local Whisper engine transcribes without a connection. You only need the internet if you turn on cloud transcription or AI cleanup.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Which apps does it work in?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Anywhere there's a text field — Gmail, Word, Google Docs, Slack, Discord, VS Code, Cursor, Notion, Obsidian, Linear, Figma, ChatGPT and more. It types into whatever window has focus.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">How accurate is the cleanup?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>You choose. Cleanup has four levels — from raw transcript, to punctuation only, to filler removal, to a full AI rewrite that matches your style. Say “backtrack” to retract a sentence on the fly.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">What languages are supported?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Twelve: English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Arabic, Russian, and Hindi — switchable mid-session from the recording overlay.</p></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q">Is there a Mac version?<span class="pm">+</span></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Super Flow is Windows 10 &amp; 11 today. Mac and mobile are on the roadmap — the download section has a spot to get notified.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

